# Play test of Mango Dell (CIPlay mango_dell, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: down into the dell, the boars, the
# treasure. Points as in its recipe.
island Mango Dell
offset 0 0
expect animals Warthog 2
wait 3
kill Warthog
walk 0 -16 to 0 -8 to 0 -2 h=2.6 below=4
expect stand 0 0 h=2.5 below=4
dig
